.SS "static int handle_any (Ecore_Ipc_Server ** server, call * cp, char * line)\fC [static]\fP"
.PP
process a command (entered in shell, parsed in \fBevsh_parse_line()\fP). 
.PP
at this point, the command is known, but its parameters still have to be parsed. the function will do this, then send the request to evidence. 
.PP
